@model (string Titulo, string Descripcion, string Periodo, string? AccionExportar)
@using TPF.RecuperacionTecnologica.Web.ViewModels.Reportes
@{
    RouteValueDictionary Enlace(FormatoExportacion formato)
    {
        var valores = new RouteValueDictionary();

        foreach (var par in Context.Request.Query)
        {
            if (!par.Key.Equals("formato", StringComparison.OrdinalIgnoreCase))
            {
                valores[par.Key] = par.Value.ToString();
            }
        }

        valores["formato"] = formato;

        return valores;
    }
}
<div class="page-head">
    <div>
        <div class="h-id"><h1 tabindex="-1">@Model.Titulo</h1></div>
        <p class="page-sub">@Model.Descripcion @Model.Periodo</p>
    </div>
    <div class="page-actions">
        @if (Model.AccionExportar is not null)
        {
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="@Url.Action(Model.AccionExportar, Enlace(FormatoExportacion.Excel))"><partial name="_Icon" model="@("file")" /><span>Descargar Excel</span></a>
            <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="@Url.Action(Model.AccionExportar, Enlace(FormatoExportacion.Pdf))"><partial name="_Icon" model="@("file")" /><span>Descargar PDF</span></a>
        }
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" asp-controller="Reportes" asp-action="Index"><partial name="_Icon" model="@("arrow-left")" /><span>Reportes</span></a>
    </div>
</div>
